{"id": "3326730", "name": "אינטגרל כפול – פיצול האינטגרנד וחישוב בשני סדרים", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 2, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_CALC2_SPLIT_TWO_ORDERS_NAMING_V2\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">פיצול האינטגרנד וחישוב בשני סדרי אינטגרציה</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\"><div>חשבו את האינטגרל</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 19px; margin: 10px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle I= \\iint_D \\left({{CT:0}}+{{CT:1}}\\right)\\,dx\\,dy \\)</div><div>כאשר:</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 18px; margin: 8px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle D= \\left\\{ (x,y): 0\\le x\\le{{CT:2}},\\ 0\\le y\\le{{CT:3}},\\ {{CT:4}}+{{CT:5}}\\ge1 \\right\\} \\)</div>\n\n\n\n\n<div style=\"background: #F8F7F9; border: 1px solid #E4DEE7; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 14px; margin-top: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 5px;\">הרעיון</div>\n<div>פצלו תחילה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle I=I_x+I_y\\)</span>. את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle I_x\\)</span> חשבו בסדר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle dy\\,dx\\)</span>, ואת <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle I_y\\)</span> בסדר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle dx\\,dy\\)</span>.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 8px;\">א. האיבר התלוי ב־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle x\\)</span></div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px; margin: 8px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle I_x= \\int_0^{{{CT:2}}} \\int_{a(x)}^{{{CT:3}}} {{CT:0}}\\,dy\\,dx \\)</div>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(260px,380px)); gap: 12px; justify-content: center; align-items: start;\">\n<div style=\"background: #F8F7F9; border: 1px solid #E4DEE7; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 14px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 8px; white-space: nowrap;\">\\(\\displaystyle a(x)=\\)[[input:ans1]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #665f6b; margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #F8F7F9; border: 1px solid #E4DEE7; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 14px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 8px; white-space: nowrap;\">\\(\\displaystyle I_x=\\)[[input:ans2]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #665f6b; margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans2]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 8px;\">ב. האיבר התלוי ב־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle y\\)</span></div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px; margin: 8px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle I_y= \\int_0^{{{CT:3}}} \\int_{c(y)}^{{{CT:2}}} {{CT:1}}\\,dx\\,dy \\)</div>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(260px,380px)); gap: 12px; justify-content: center; align-items: start;\">\n<div style=\"background: #F8F7F9; border: 1px solid #E4DEE7; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 14px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 8px; white-space: nowrap;\">\\(\\displaystyle c(y)=\\)[[input:ans3]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #665f6b; margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans3]]</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #F8F7F9; border: 1px solid #E4DEE7; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 14px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 8px; white-space: nowrap;\">\\(\\displaystyle I_y=\\)[[input:ans4]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #665f6b; margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans4]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 8px;\">ג. התוצאה הסופית</div>\n<div style=\"max-width: 320px; margin: 0 auto; background: #F8F7F9; border: 1px solid #E4DEE7; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 14px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 8px; white-space: nowrap;\">\\(\\displaystyle I=\\)[[input:ans5]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #665f6b; margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans5]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_CALC2_NO_MINMAX_V2\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<p>נכתוב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle I=I_x+I_y\\)</span>, כאשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle I_x=\\iint_D{{CT:0}}\\,dA\\)</span> ו־ <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle I_y=\\iint_D{{CT:1}}\\,dA\\)</span>.</p>\n<p>מן הישר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:4}}+{{CT:5}}=1\\)</span> נקבל בסריקה אנכית</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px; margin: 8px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle 0\\le x\\le{{CT:2}}, \\qquad {{CT:6}}\\le y\\le{{CT:3}} \\)</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px; margin: 8px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle I_x= \\int_0^{{{CT:2}}}\\int_{{{CT:6}}}^{{{CT:3}}}{{CT:0}}\\,dy\\,dx ={{CT:7}} \\)</div>\n<p>בחירה בסדר ההפוך הייתה מחייבת אינטגרציה ישירה לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span> של פונקציה מן הצורה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(e^{cx^2}\\)</span>, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\sin(cx^2)\\)</span> או <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\cos(cx^2)\\)</span>.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<p>בסריקה אופקית מתקבל</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px; margin: 8px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle 0\\le y\\le{{CT:3}}, \\qquad {{CT:8}}\\le x\\le{{CT:2}} \\)</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px; margin: 8px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle I_y= \\int_0^{{{CT:3}}}\\int_{{{CT:8}}}^{{{CT:2}}}{{CT:1}}\\,dx\\,dy ={{CT:9}} \\)</div>\n<p>כאן הבחירה בסדר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle dx\\,dy\\)</span> היא שמייצרת את הגורם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y\\)</span> והופכת את האינטגרל לאלמנטרי.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 18px;\">\\(\\displaystyle I=I_x+I_y={{CT:7}}+{{CT:9}}={{CT:10}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">[[feedback:prt1]] [[feedback:prt2]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">חלק מן התשובה נכון. בדקו את שאר הרכיבים.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה עדיין אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 12, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 16, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 12, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 16, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans5", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 18, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 4, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "correct:if is(equal(ans1,ymin)) and is(equal(ans2,Ix)) and is(equal(ans3,xmin)) and is(equal(ans4,Iy)) then true else false;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "correct", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 2, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans5", "tans": "val", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_tr